  "title": "Alpha Tau Announces Strong Overall Survival Results from Alpha DaRT® Pancreatic Cancer Studies Presented at 2026 ASCO Annual Meeting",
  "summary": "Jerusalem, June 1, 2026 – Alpha Tau Medical Ltd. (Nasdaq: DRTS, DRTSW) (“Alpha Tau”, or the “Company”), the developer of the innovative alpha-radiation cancer therapy Alpha DaRT®, today announced positive overall survival and safety results from a pooled analysis of three prospective Phase I/II clinical studies evaluating endoscopic ultrasound (EUS)-guided intratumoral Alpha DaRT treatment in patients […]",
